WEBVTT

00:04:28.848 --> 00:04:31.767
"Well, of course, that makes
so much sense, why wouldn't you?

00:04:31.767 --> 00:04:33.561
Bet on her. Yeah, she's a winner."

00:04:34.437 --> 00:04:37.523
But at the time, the data
would tell us differently.

00:04:38.983 --> 00:04:44.322
No, there are not a lot of solo artists
that come out of girl groups

00:04:44.363 --> 00:04:45.614
and are successful.

00:04:46.157 --> 00:04:47.992
In my opinion, there is only one.

00:04:48.034 --> 00:04:49.201
(Laughs)

00:04:49.201 --> 00:04:50.369
Diana Ross.

00:04:51.454 --> 00:04:52.872
Yeah, the one.

00:04:52.913 --> 00:04:54.457
(Laughter)

00:04:54.457 --> 00:04:55.750
Beyoncé is another.

00:04:56.542 --> 00:04:59.337
So at the time, nobody was betting on her.